{
 "version": 1,
 "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-2",
 "asignatura": "matematicas",
 "anio": 2022,
 "convocatoria": "Reserva 2",
 "documento": null,
 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-2-1",
   "n": 1,
   "bloque": "A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función continua definida por \\[f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2+2&\\text{si }x\\le0\\\\\\sqrt{ax+b}&\\text{si }0\\lt x\\le2\\\\\\dfrac{-x}{2\\sqrt2}+\\dfrac3{\\sqrt2}&\\text{si }2\\lt x\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,25 p.) Calcula \\(a\\) y \\(b\\).",
     "(1,25 p.) Para \\(a=-1\\) y \\(b=4\\), estudia si existe la derivada de \\(f\\) en \\(x=2\\). En caso afirmativo, calcula la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(f\\) en dicho punto."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Continuidad en \\(x=0\\) y en \\(x=2\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(f\\) continua en \\(x_0\\iff\\lim_{x\\to x_0^-}f=\\lim_{x\\to x_0^+}f=f(x_0)\\).</i>:</p>\\[x=0:\\ f(0)=2=\\sqrt{b}\\Rightarrow b=4\\qquad x=2:\\ \\sqrt{2a+b}=\\frac{-2}{2\\sqrt2}+\\frac3{\\sqrt2}=\\frac2{\\sqrt2}=\\sqrt2\\Rightarrow2a+4=2\\Rightarrow a=-1\\]<div class='res'>\\(a=-1\\) y \\(b=4\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Con \\(a=-1\\), \\(b=4\\): \\(f(x)=\\sqrt{4-x}\\) en \\((0,2]\\) y \\(f'(x)=-\\dfrac1{2\\sqrt{4-x}}\\). Derivadas laterales en \\(x=2\\):</p>\\[f'(2^-)=-\\frac1{2\\sqrt2}\\qquad f'(2^+)=-\\frac1{2\\sqrt2}\\ (\\text{pendiente del tercer tramo})\\]<p>Coinciden: \\(f\\) es derivable en \\(x=2\\), con \\(f(2)=\\sqrt2\\) y \\(f'(2)=-\\frac1{2\\sqrt2}=-\\frac{\\sqrt2}4\\).</p><div class='res'>Sí existe: \\(f'(2)=-\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}4\\). Tangente: \\(y-\\sqrt2=-\\dfrac{\\sqrt2}4(x-2)\\), es decir, \\(y=-\\dfrac x{2\\sqrt2}+\\dfrac3{\\sqrt2}\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "cont",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": null
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "revisado"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-2-2",
   "n": 2,
   "bloque": "A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(f:\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(f(x)=\\ln(x^2+1)\\) (donde \\(\\ln\\) denota la función logaritmo neperiano).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Determina los intervalos de convexidad y de concavidad de \\(f\\) y los puntos de inflexión de su gráfica."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{2x}{x^2+1}\\]<p>El denominador es positivo: \\(f'\\gt0\\iff x\\gt0\\) y \\(f'\\lt0\\iff x\\lt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>.</p><div class='res'>Decreciente en \\((-\\infty,0)\\) y creciente en \\((0,+\\infty)\\) (mínimo en \\(x=0\\), \\(f(0)=0\\))</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[f''(x)=\\frac{2(x^2+1)-2x\\cdot2x}{(x^2+1)^2}=\\frac{2(1-x^2)}{(x^2+1)^2}\\]<p>El signo de \\(f''\\) es el de \\(1-x^2\\): positivo en \\((-1,1)\\) y negativo fuera. \\(f''\\) cambia de signo en \\(x=\\pm1\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f''\\gt0\\), \\(f\\) es convexa; si \\(f''\\lt0\\), cóncava. Un punto donde \\(f''\\) cambia de signo y \\(f\\) es continua es de inflexión.</i>, con \\(f(\\pm1)=\\ln2\\).</p><div class='res'>Convexa en \\((-1,1)\\); cóncava en \\((-\\infty,-1)\\) y en \\((1,+\\infty)\\). Puntos de inflexión: \\((-1,\\ln2)\\) y \\((1,\\ln2)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "mono",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "curv",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": null
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "revisado"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-2-3",
   "n": 3,
   "bloque": "A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera la función \\(F:[0,2\\pi]\\to\\mathbb R\\) definida por \\(F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^x2t\\cos(t)\\,dt\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Determina los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento de \\(F\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Halla la ecuación de la recta tangente a la gráfica de \\(F\\) en el punto de abscisa \\(x=\\pi\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Por el teorema fundamental del cálculo<i class='n' data-t='th'>Teorema fundamental del cálculo: si \\(g\\) es continua, \\(F(x)=\\int_0^xg(t)\\,dt\\) es derivable y \\(F'(x)=g(x)\\).</i>, \\(F'(x)=2x\\cos x\\). Para \\(x\\in(0,2\\pi)\\), \\(2x\\gt0\\) y el signo es el de \\(\\cos x\\):</p><table class='tb'><tr><th>Intervalo</th><th>\\((0,\\frac\\pi2)\\)</th><th>\\((\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2)\\)</th><th>\\((\\frac{3\\pi}2,2\\pi)\\)</th></tr><tr><td>\\(F'\\)</td><td>\\(+\\)</td><td>\\(-\\)</td><td>\\(+\\)</td></tr><tr><td>\\(F\\)</td><td>crece</td><td>decrece</td><td>crece</td></tr></table><div class='res'>Crece en \\((0,\\frac\\pi2)\\) y en \\((\\frac{3\\pi}2,2\\pi)\\); decrece en \\((\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2)\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(F'(\\pi)=2\\pi\\cos\\pi=-2\\pi\\). Y \\(F(\\pi)=\\int_0^\\pi2t\\cos t\\,dt\\), por partes (\\(u=2t\\), \\(dv=\\cos t\\,dt\\); polinomio antes que coseno en ALPES<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla ALPES: Arcos, Logaritmos, Polinomios, Exponenciales, Senos/cosenos: \\(u\\) es lo que aparece antes.</i>):</p>\\[\\int2t\\cos t\\,dt=2t\\operatorname{sen}t-\\int2\\operatorname{sen}t\\,dt=2t\\operatorname{sen}t+2\\cos t\\ \\Rightarrow\\ F(\\pi)=\\bigl[2t\\operatorname{sen}t+2\\cos t\\bigr]_0^\\pi=-2-2=-4\\]<div class='res'>\\(y+4=-2\\pi(x-\\pi)\\), es decir, \\(y=-2\\pi x+2\\pi^2-4\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tfc",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "mono",
     "apartados": "a"
    },
    {
     "tema": "funciones",
     "tipo": "tang",
     "apartados": "b"
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": null
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "revisado"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-2-4",
   "n": 4,
   "bloque": "A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Calcula \\(\\displaystyle\\int_0^1x\\operatorname{arctg}(x)\\,dx\\) (donde \\(\\operatorname{arctg}\\) denota la función arcotangente).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Integración por partes",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Arcos (A) antes que polinomios (P) en ALPES<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla ALPES: Arcos, Logaritmos, Polinomios, Exponenciales, Senos/cosenos. Aquí \\(u=\\operatorname{arctg}x\\) y \\(dv=x\\,dx\\).</i>: \\(u=\\operatorname{arctg}x\\), \\(dv=x\\,dx\\Rightarrow du=\\dfrac{dx}{1+x^2}\\), \\(v=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\):</p>\\[\\int x\\operatorname{arctg}x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}2\\operatorname{arctg}x-\\frac12\\int\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}2\\operatorname{arctg}x-\\frac12\\int\\left(1-\\frac1{1+x^2}\\right)dx\\]\\[=\\frac{x^2}2\\operatorname{arctg}x-\\frac x2+\\frac12\\operatorname{arctg}x\\]</div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Regla de Barrow",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\int_0^1x\\operatorname{arctg}x\\,dx=\\left[\\frac{x^2+1}2\\operatorname{arctg}x-\\frac x2\\right]_0^1=\\left(\\operatorname{arctg}1-\\frac12\\right)-0\\]<div class='res'>\\(\\dfrac\\pi4-\\dfrac12\\approx0{,}2854\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
   "clasificacion": [
    {
     "tema": "integ",
     "tipo": "part",
     "apartados": ""
    }
   ],
   "origen": {
    "documento": null
   },
   "dificultad": null,
   "etiquetas": [],
   "revision": "revisado"
  },
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2022-reserva-2-5",
   "n": 5,
   "bloque": "B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Considera el sistema: \\[\\begin{cases}2x+3y+mz=3\\\\x+my-z=-1\\\\3x+y-3z=-m\\end{cases}\\]",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,75 p.) Discute el sistema según los valores de \\(m\\).",
     "(0,75 p.) Para \\(m=-2\\) encuentra, si es posible, \\(y_0\\) para que la solución del sistema sea \\(x=\\lambda\\), \\(y=y_0\\), \\(z=\\lambda-\\dfrac37\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Calculo \\(|M|\\) por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[|M|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&3&m\\\\1&m&-1\\\\3&1&-3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- 6 m-9+m\\bigr)-\\bigl(3 m^{2}-2-9\\bigr)\\]\\[=-3m^2-5m+2=-(3m-1)(m+2)\\]<p>Por Rouché-Frobenius<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(\\operatorname{rg}M=\\operatorname{rg}M^*=3\\): SCD; \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=\\operatorname{rg}M^*\\lt3\\): SCI; \\(\\operatorname{rg}M\\lt\\operatorname{rg}M^*\\): SI.</i>:</p><p>• \\(m\\neq\\frac13,-2\\): compatible determinado.</p><p>• \\(m=-2\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=2\\) (menor \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&3\\\\1&-2\\end{vmatrix}=-7\\neq0\\)). En \\(M^*\\) (términos \\(3,-1,2\\)), calculo el menor de las columnas 1, 2 y 4 por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2&3&3\\\\1&-2&-1\\\\3&1&2\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-8-9+3\\bigr)-\\bigl(-18-2+6\\bigr)\\]\\[=0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}M^*=2\\). Compatible indeterminado.</p><p>• \\(m=\\frac13\\): \\(\\operatorname{rg}M=2\\) (menor \\(\\begin{vmatrix}2&3\\\\1&\\frac13\\end{vmatrix}=-\\frac73\\)). En \\(M^*\\) (términos \\(3,-1,-\\frac13\\)), calculo el menor de las columnas 1, 2 y 4 por la regla de Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[\\begin{vmatrix}2&3&3\\\\1&\\frac13&-1\\\\3&1&-\\frac13\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(- \\frac{2}{9}-9+3\\bigr)-\\bigl(3-2-1\\bigr)\\]\\[=-\\frac{56}9\\neq0\\]<p>\\(\\operatorname{rg}M^*=3\\). Incompatible.</p><div class='res'>\\(m\\neq\\frac13,-2\\): SCD. \\(m=-2\\): SCI. \\(m=\\frac13\\): SI</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Para \\(m=-2\\): \\(2x+3y-2z=3\\), \\(x-2y-z=-1\\), \\(3x+y-3z=2\\). Sustituyo \\(x=\\lambda\\), \\(y=y_0\\), \\(z=\\lambda-\\frac37\\) en la 2.ª ecuación:</p>\\[\\lambda-2y_0-\\lambda+\\frac37=-1\\iff-2y_0=-\\frac{10}7\\iff y_0=\\frac57\\]<p>Se comprueba en las otras: \\(2\\lambda+\\frac{15}7-2\\lambda+\\frac67=3\\) ✓ y \\(3\\lambda+\\frac57-3\\lambda+\\frac97=2\\) ✓.</p><div class='res'>\\(y_0=\\dfrac57\\): la solución es \\(\\left(\\lambda,\\ \\dfrac57,\\ \\lambda-\\dfrac37\\right)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
