   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\): punto \\(R(0,1,0)\\) y dirección \\(\\vec d=(1,-1,0)\\); normal de \\(\\pi\\): \\(\\vec n=(1,1,1)\\). El plano buscado contiene a \\(\\vec d\\) y, al ser perpendicular a \\(\\pi\\), contiene a \\(\\vec n\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Un plano es perpendicular a otro si sus normales son perpendiculares: contiene la dirección de la normal del otro.</i>. Su normal:</p>\\[\\vec N=\\vec d\\times\\vec n=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\1&-1&0\\\\1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-1,-1,2)\\sim(1,1,-2)\\]\\[x+y-2z+D=0\\ \\text{por }R:\\ 1+D=0\\Rightarrow D=-1\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-33,\"el\":54,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-2.03,2.364,-0.333],[1.364,-1.03,-0.333],[0.547,-1.847,1.3],[-2.847,1.547,1.3]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[0.547,-1.847,1.3],\"π\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[-2.03,2.364,-0.333],[1.364,-1.03,-0.333],[2.518,0.124,0.821],[-0.876,3.518,0.821]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"txt\",[2.518,0.124,0.821],\"β\",\"#b45309\",4,0],[\"line\",[-1.8,2.8,0.0],[1.8,-0.8,0.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.8,-0.8,0.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[0.8,0.2,0.0],[1.507,-0.507,0.0],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0,0,0],[0.693,0.693,0.693],\"#dc2626\",\"n_π\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[0,1,0],\"R\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n525n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n525d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n525g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n525r' viewBox='0 0 