   "bloque": "B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sean los planos \\(\\pi_1\\equiv2x+y+z-3=0\\), \\(\\pi_2\\equiv x+2y-z+5=0\\) y la recta \\(r\\equiv x-1=\\dfrac y2=\\dfrac{z+1}5\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(2 p.) Halla los puntos de \\(r\\) que equidistan de \\(\\pi_1\\) y \\(\\pi_2\\).",
     "(0,5 p.) Halla el seno del ángulo que forma el plano \\(\\pi_1\\) con la recta \\(r\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\equiv(1+t,\\ 2t,\\ -1+5t)\\). Distancias de un punto de \\(r\\) a cada plano<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(d(P,\\pi)=\\dfrac{|Ax_0+By_0+Cz_0+D|}{\\sqrt{A^2+B^2+C^2}}\\). Ambos planos tienen \\(\\sqrt6\\) en el denominador: basta igualar los numeradores.</i>:</p>\\[|2(1+t)+2t+(-1+5t)-3|=|9t-2|\\qquad|(1+t)+4t-(-1+5t)+5|=|7|\\]\\[|9t-2|=7\\iff9t-2=7\\ \\text{o}\\ 9t-2=-7\\iff t=1\\ \\text{o}\\ t=-\\tfrac59\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":57,\"el\":8,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[-0.787,2.566,2.008],[1.181,-1.369,2.008],[2.787,-0.566,-2.008],[0.819,3.369,-2.008]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"txt\",[2.787,-0.566,-2.008],\"π₁\",\"#7c3aed\",4,0],[\"poly\",[[-2.566,-0.213,2.008],[1.369,-2.181,2.008],[0.566,-3.787,-2.008],[-3.369,-1.819,-2.008]],\"#f59e0b\",\"#b45309\"],[\"txt\",[0.566,-3.787,-2.008],\"π₂\",\"#b45309\",4,0],[\"line\",[-0.2,-2.4,-7.0],[2.3,2.6,5.5],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[2.3,2.6,5.5],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[1.5,1.0,1.5],[1.719,1.438,2.595],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"pt\",[2,2,4],\"X₁\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0.444,-1.111,-3.778],\"X₂\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n526n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n526d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n526g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='n526r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><polygon points='118.4,81.3 43.9,75.2 26.